# 只跟踪产品代码与开发记录；其余目录（会话、备份、日志、文档草稿）一律不入库
/*
!/.gitignore
!/devlog/
!/fishdesk/
!/wechat-bridge/

# 通用垃圾
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.log
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- 含真实 wxid / 群 id / 聊天内容 / 运行日志的东西，绝不入库 ---
/wechat-bridge/_peek.py
/wechat-bridge/diary.md
/wechat-bridge/incoming/
/wechat-bridge/*.jsonl
/wechat-bridge/*.bak-*
/wechat-bridge/*.orig-*
/wechat-bridge/旧人设*.md
/wechat-bridge/wechat-bridge-state.json
/wechat-bridge/sticker-lock.json
/wechat-bridge/backups/
/wechat-bridge/sessions-archive/
/wechat-bridge/memory/
/wechat-bridge/power/*.log
/wechat-bridge/power/last_*.txt
